\dNot your friends, or other teachers. ...And don't even\nthink about confirming it with her.\d%K%P
「不管是对朋友还是对别的老师。\n…更不能去找本人确认」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI promise I won't.\nI'm only worried about you.\d%K%P
「我保证。\n我只是关心理君你而已嘛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Thanks.\d%K%P
「…谢谢」%K%P
It wasn't like telling her would solve the issue.%K%P
即使说了也无济于事。%K%P
If anything, I was probably betraying Asami's trust by\nopening my mouth. Actually, I most definitely was.%K%P
非但如此，这也许还是对麻实的背叛。\n不如说，基本上就是背叛了。%K%P
But I had decided to never lie to this girl anymore.%K%P
但是我已经下决心要对都子老实坦白了。%K%P
I wasn't trying to mimic Himeo, but I didn't want to have\nany secrets between Toko and myself, either.%K%P
虽然不是姬绪小姐，\n但我也不想在我与都子间存在秘密。%K%P
...Not sure how good that was for her education, though.%K%P
…这也许是教育方面临近界限的事了。%K%P
